## Model card

- **Name:** Space Bunny Alpha
- **Short description:** Newly appeared anonymous ("stealth") model hosted from the OpenRouter stealth slot, also on OpenCode (Zen `opencode/space-bunny-alpha`). No vendor has claimed authorship; specs claim fast inference, strong coding, native multimodal input, always-on reasoning with adjustable effort, and a 1M-token context window. No benchmark of any kind has been published.
- **Provider / access:** OpenRouter `stealth/space-bunny-alpha` (Chat Completions); OpenCode Zen `opencode/space-bunny-alpha`.
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-09-23 (first appeared on OpenRouter/OpenCode per posts dated 2026-09-23/24); knowledge cutoff not disclosed.
- **IDs:** `stealth/space-bunny-alpha`, `opencode/space-bunny-alpha`
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens total (listing spec); max output 524,288 tokens (listing spec). Not benchmark-verified.
- **Modalities:** text + image + video input per listings; text output; tool calling; mandatory reasoning (adjustable effort). Community tokenizer probing suggests alignment with MiniMax M3 tokenizer (informal, not a benchmark).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-24):** $0.00 / $0.00 per 1M input/output tokens (free while the stealth preview lasts; post-window pricing unknown).
- **Architecture:** unknown — no weights, no parameter count, no license, no vendor page.

